<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Procter &amp; Gamble target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Procter &amp; Gamble target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it raised the 12-month price target on Procter &amp; Gamble Co to $170 from $155.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Procter &amp; Gamble set a two-for-one stock split and raised its annual common stock dividend to $2.02 a share from $1.80 a share.</p>
<p>-- Procter &amp; Gamble gained 4-1/8 to 153-1/2.</p>
</text>
